  "definition": "Conditions for Applying Pesticides by Aerial Methods in Residential Areas",
  "effectiveDate": "2024-08-22",
  "historyNote": "#2666, eff 4-3-84; ss by #2781, eff 7-26-84; ss by #4867, eff 7-19-90; ss by #6258, eff 5-30-96; ss by #6834, eff 8-26-98; ss by #8131, eff 8-13-04; ss by #10333, eff 5-10-13; ss by #14064, eff 8-22-24",
